    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu tshidimu tshia makumi abidi ne muanda mutekete tshia bukelenge bua Yalobama, mukelenge wa Isalele, Uziya, muana wa Amasaya, mukelenge wa Yuda, wakabanga kukokesha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakadi ne bidimu dikumi ne bisambombo hakabangeye kukokesha; wakakokesha mu Yelushalema tô bidimu makumi atanu ne bibidi; dina dia mamu wandi diakadi Yekoliya wa mu Yelushalema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakenza malu mimpe ku mesu kua Yehowa bu muakenza Amasaya, tatu wandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi kakumusha bitendelelu bia ku mikuna; bantu batshivua bafila milambu ya kuosha ha kahia ne musenga wa manananshi ha mutu ha mikuna. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa wakasamisha mukelenge ne disama dia nsudi tô ne ku dituku dia lufu luandi; wakashikama mu nsubu ha buandi. Yotama, muana wa mukelenge, wakadi ku mutu kua nsubu wandi ulumbulula malu a bantu ba mu buloba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bienzedi bia Uziya bikuabo ne malu onso biakenzeye kabiena bifunda mu mukanda wa kulondolola kua malu a bakelenge ha Yuda, anyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uziya wakalala tulu ne bankambua bandi, bakamujika hohamue ne bankambua bandi mu musoko wa Davidi. Yotama, muanʼandi, wakakokesha mu muaba wandi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu tshidimu tshia makumi asatu ne muanda mukulu tshia bukelenge bua Uziya, mukelenge wa Yuda, Zekâya, muana wa Yalobama, wakakokesha Bena Isalele mu Samalea anu ngondo isambombo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakenza malu mabi ku mesu kua Yehowa bu muakenza batatuʼandi; kakasesuka ku malu mabi a Yalobama, muana wa Nebata, akenzesheye Bena Isalele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shaluma, muana wa Yabesha, wakamuelela tshifufu, wakamukuma ku mesu kua bantu, wakamushiha, wakakokesha mu muaba wandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bienzedi bia Zekâya bikuabo bidi bifunda mu mukanda wa kulondolola kua malu a bakelenge ba Isalele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Edi ndi diakambila Yehowa Yehu ne, Bana bebe nebashikame ku nkuasa wa bukelenge wa Isalele tô ne ku tshikondo tshinai. Bualu ebu buakenjibua.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu tshidimu tshia makumi asatu ne tshitema tshia bukelenge bua Uziya, mukelenge wa Yuda, Shaluma, muana wa Yabesha, wakabanga kukokesha; wakabakokesha mu Samalea ngondo umue. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Menahema, muana wa Gadi, wakafuma ku Tîsa, wakaya ku Samalea, wakakuma Shaluma, muana wa Yabesha, mu Samalea, wakamushiha, wakakokesha mu muaba wandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bienzedi bia Shaluma bikuabo ne tshifufu tshiakeleye bidi bifunda mu mukanda wa kulondolola kua malu a bakelenge ba Isalele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe Menahema wakahaula musoko wa Tifesa, wakashiha bantu bakadiku tô ne ku Tîsa; bualu bua bobo kabakunzulula bibi ku mpala kuandi, yeye wakabashiha; bakashi bonso bakadi ne mafu, yeye wakabahanda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu tshidimu tshia makumi asatu ne tshitema tshia bukelenge bua Uziya, mukelenge wa Yuda, Menahema, muana wa Gadi, wakabanga kukokesha Bena Isalele; wakakokesha mu Samalea bidimu dikumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakenza malu mabi ku mesu kua Yehowa; kakasesuka mu malu mabi a Yalobama, muana wa Nebata, akenzesheye Bena Isalele matuku andi onso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pula, mukelenge wa Ashû, wakalua bua kuhaula buloba. Menahema wakaha Pula ntalanta",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15.19:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Tangila 2 Bakelenge 5.5.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ya argent tshinunu, bua yeye amukuatshishe bua kujadikeye bukelenge mu tshianza tshiandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Menahema wakalambuisha Bena Isalele, bantu babanji bonso, nshekele",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15.20:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Tangila 2 Bakelenge 6.25.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ya argent makumi atanu kudi muntu ne muntu, bua kulambuleye mukelenge wa Ashû. Nunku mukelenge wa Ashû wakahingana kuabo, kakashikama mu buloba bua Isalele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bienzedi bikuabo bia Menahema ne malu onso akenzeye kabiena bifunda mu mukanda wa kulondolola kua malu a bakelenge ba Isalele, anyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Menahema wakalala tulu ne bankambua bandi; Pekaya, muanʼandi, wakakokesha mu muaba wandi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
