          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu tshidimu tshia makumi atanu tshia bukelenge bua Uziya, mukelenge wa Yuda, Pekaya, muana wa Menahema, wakabanga kukokesha Bena Isalele mu Samalea; wakabakokesha bidimu bibidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakenza malu mabi ku mesu kua Yehowa; kakasesuka mu malu mabi a Yalobama, muana wa Nebata, akenzesheye Bena Isalele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Peka, muana mulume wa Lemalaya, kapitene ka masalayi andi wakamuelela tshifufu, wakamukuma mu Samalea mu nsubu wa mukelenge; Âgoba ne Aliye ne Bena Gilada makumi atanu bakadi nʼandi; yeye wakamushiha, wakakokesha mu muaba wandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bienzedi bikuabo bia Pekaya ne malu onso akenzeye bidi bifunda mu mukanda wa kulondolola kua malu a bakelenge ba Isalele.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.26",
